    <Description>This micro script is designed for Digimon Masters Online (DMO) to automate farming Digimons efficiently. It performs key actions such as targeting nearby Digimons, executing attacks, and collecting loot while ensuring smooth gameplay. The script operates by detecting enemy spawns, engaging in combat using predefined skills, and maintaining character health through auto-healing mechanics.


Features:

Auto-targeting – Detects and selects Digimons automatically.

Skill Execution – Uses specific attack skills in a loop.

Auto-looting – Picks up dropped items after battle.

Health &amp; MP Monitoring – Uses potions when needed.


This script is lightweight and can be customized for different farming locations and Digimon types. It helps players efficiently grind XP, items, and Digi-Eggs without constant manual control.</Description>
